  "content_description": "",
  "content_text_body": "Schedule 1:1 meetings with your team where the goal is to learn how you can help each person feel more empowered in their day-to-day work. Give your team members a heads-up (via email or in person) about what you'd like to talk about and how they can help.\n\n### Prior to the discussion\n\nAsk each team member to answer the following questions (which you'll go over together in your 1:1's):\n\n> What work situations or experiences make you feel empowered?\n\n> How do you feel about the balance of structure and flexibility at work?\n\n> Are there any processes that are limiting you from feeling empowered? \n\n> If so, can you think of any ways to change them so that you feel more empowered?\n\n> Is there anything I am doing that prevents you from feeling empowered? \n\n> If so, how could I better enable you to feel empowered?\n\nUse these [1:1 Meeting Tips](Glint_Empowerment_1:1_Meeting_Tips) and follow this [Meeting Plan](Glint_Empowerment_1:1_Meeting_Plan) to prepare for your individual meetings.",
